Package: etvar
Title: Event-Targeted Vector Autoregression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jakub", "Cery", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jakub.cery@euba.sk")
Description: Estimates structural vector autoregressive (VAR) models identified
    by targeting one or more event dates, following the event-targeted VAR
    approach of Pinter, Smets and Üslü (2025)
    <https://www.bis.org/publications/working-paper-1282-market-whiplash-after-2025-tariff-shock-event-targeted-var-approach>.
    The package finds the orthogonal rotation of the Cholesky factor that best
    explains observed movements on the event dates using a single structural
    shock. It provides tools for impulse response analysis, structural
    forecast error variance decomposition, historical decomposition
    (including counterfactual intervention paths), and diagnostic plots.
